    "Name": "Quickdraw",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Heavy Ballistic Support. The QKD-QS4 is our dedicated Anti-air platform. It comes with twin Double AC5s loaded with Flak rounds designed specifically to shoot down those pesky targets. It also has a specially licenced Flak FCS and light AA missile packs to make sure that those birds get downed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>",
